Proposed closeout claim(제안 마감 주장):
- This is runtime probe observation only(런타임 탐침 관찰 전용).
- No completion candidate(완성 후보), baseline(기준선), promotion(승격), runtime authority(런타임 권위), live readiness(실거래 준비), or Goal Achieve(목표 달성).
- F13/F14 OOS PF/DD are preserved clues(보존 단서) only because validation drawdown(검증 손실폭) and trade density(거래 밀도) fail.
- Earlier dense stages mostly become negative memory(부정 기억) because DD is far above 10%.

Question(질문):
